flowchart TD
  caller["Start here: caller task<br/>and exact ending commands"]:::start
  settings["Settings: local sources or,<br/>without sources, the default<br/>skill directory, and mandatory<br/>file references"]
  resolve["Ravel CLI: capture local bytes<br/>no fetch and no VCS command"]
  publish["Publish snapshots and<br/>the directory descriptor"]
  refusal["Stage skills refusal:<br/>no worker, no launch"]
  prepare["Preamble and loading rules<br/>around the intact caller block"]
  worker["Rhai worker, schema 4:<br/>originalPrompt, prompt, skills"]
  select["load_context and select<br/>each receive a copy of one request"]
  launch["Script puts request.prompt<br/>into the harness arguments"]
  agent["Agent reads mandatory files<br/>before caller actions"]
  names["Name request: supplied directories first<br/>tool or path: explicit-route rules"]
  caller -->|1. keep exact bytes| prepare
  settings -->|2. resolve before the worker| resolve
  resolve -->|3. check resources| publish
  resolve -->|unavailable or invalid| refusal
  publish -->|4. absolute paths, no skill entries| prepare
  prepare -->|5. evaluate frame| worker
  worker -->|6. evaluate| select
  select -->|7. selection| launch
  launch -->|8. deliver paths and reads| agent
  agent -->|9. discover and load| names
  classDef start fill:#173451,color:#fff,stroke:#102a43,font-weight:bold
